  {
    "id": "20261109-150012",
    "rubric": "Donalik va kichik buyurtmalar",
    "title": "Taobao: Kupon uchun ortiqcha buyum olish kerakmi?",
    "text": "🛍 <b>TAOBAO’DA KUPON UCHUN ORTIQCHA BUYUM OLISH KERAKMI?</b>\n\n11.11 chegirmasida kupon olish uchun keraksiz buyum qo‘shish har doim ham foydali emas.\n\n<b>Qanday solishtirasiz?</b>\n1️⃣ Kuponning amal qilish shartini o‘qing.\n2️⃣ Kerakli buyumning to‘lovdagi jami narxini yozib oling.\n3️⃣ Qo‘shimcha buyum qo‘shib, kupondan keyingi jami narxni tekshiring.\n4️⃣ Ikki summani solishtiring.\n\n<b>Misol: sumka xaridi</b>\nFaqat sumka | to‘lovdagi jami\nSumka va qo‘shimcha buyum | kupondan keyingi jami\n\nIkkinchi summa yuqori bo‘lsa, kupon uchun ortiqcha buyum olishga shoshilmang.\n\nImmensus Post uchun manbalar: <a href=\"https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/online-shopping\">Manba</a> | <a href=\"https://consumer.ftc.gov/media/79929\">Manba</a>\n\n📌 Foydali bo'lsa, postni saqlab qo'ying va yaqinlaringizga ulashing. 🔔 Xitoy platformalari bo'yicha sodda qo'llanmalar — @immensuspost\n\n#ImmensusPost #XitoydanBuyurtma #FoydaliMaslahat",
    "kind": "photo",
    "file_id": "AgACAgUAAxkDAAIBT2rx4JCWnv8t8m_9ejcRF1rC3LBfAALPFGsbfz6RV-KYhJcYVloPAQADAgADeQADPQQ",
    "media_path": "/home/runner/work/immensus-post/immensus-post/.work/20261109-150012/image.png",
    "topic": {
      "title": "Taobao: Kupon uchun ortiqcha buyum olish kerakmi?",
      "angle": "Kupon shartini tekshirib, kerakli buyum narxini qo‘shimcha mahsulot qo‘shilgan savat bilan jadvalda solishtiring.",
      "why_now": "11.11 chegirmalari paytida kupon ortiqcha xaridga undamayotganini tekshirish foydali.",
      "research": "Tekshiruv sanasi: **2026-yil 9-noyabr**. Quyidagi mavzular Xitoy ichki bozoridagi xarid sahifalari uchun moslashtirilgan. 11.11 aksiyalari davrida mahsulot tafsilotlari va aksiya shartlarini tekshirish ayniqsa dolzarb. ([samr.gov.cn](https://www.samr.gov.cn/xw/zj/art/2026/art_c79205935e4b4ef889a85c60a32cd304.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n1. **Taobao: Kurtka yengining uzunligi sizga mosmi?**\n   - **Burchak:** O‘zingizga mos kurtkaning yengini o‘lchab, yangi mahsulot jadvalidagi yeng uzunligi bilan solishtirish. **Format:** sodda illyustratsiya.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Sovuq mavsumda ustki kiyim tanlashda foydali.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([consumer.ftc.gov](https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/online-shopping?utm_source=openai))\n\n2. **Pinduoduo: Saqlash qutisi javonga sig‘adimi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Javonning eni va chuqurligini o‘lchab, quti tavsifidagi tashqi o‘lchamlar bilan solishtirish. **Format:** qisqa tekshiruv ro‘yxati.\n   - **Nega hozir:** 11.11 savdosida uy uchun buyum olayotganda rasmga qarab o‘lchamni taxmin qilishdan saqlaydi.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([legalinfo.moj.gov.cn](https://legalinfo.moj.gov.cn/pub/sfbzhfx/zhfxfzzx/fzzxyw/202308/t20230821_484686.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n3. **Tmall: Termosning ichki qismi nimadan yasalgan?**\n   - **Burchak:** Tavsifdan aynan ichki qism materiali haqidagi yozuvni izlash; ma’lumot noaniq bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan so‘rash. **Format:** ikki belgili infografika.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Sovuq mavsumda issiq ichimlik uchun termos tanlayotganlarga kerak.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([samr.gov.cn](https://www.samr.gov.cn/rkjcs/sjdt/hd/art/2026/art_91231da94557494cb76a6a1413cedf92.html?utm_source=openai))\n\n4. **Pinduoduo: Telefon g‘ilofi modelingizga mosmi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Telefon sozlamalaridagi to‘liq model nomini mahsulot variantidagi nom bilan solishtirish. **Format:** yonma-yon taqqoslash.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Aksiya paytida shoshilib, o‘xshash nomli boshqa modelni tanlab yubormaslik uchun.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([scjg.lasa.gov.cn](https://scjg.lasa.gov.cn/scjgj/xxyw/202606/ba331949b937428bbd197ee5f48ae63b.shtml?utm_source=openai))\n\n5. **Taobao: Kiyimni uyda yuva olasizmi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Qishki kiyim tavsifidan yuvish ko‘rsatmasini izlash; topilmasa, sotuvchidan so‘rash. **Format:** yuvish belgilariga oid sodda infografika.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Mavsumiy kiyimni olishdan oldin uni parvarish qilish o‘zingizga qulayligini bilib olasiz.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([shcn.gov.cn](https://www.shcn.gov.cn/col7431/20260212/1305475/63c2e1dc823847dfb0950482573b90f8.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\n6. **Poizon: Poyabzalni ko‘rgach, darhol yorlig‘ini uzish kerakmi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Avval poyabzalni tekshirish; qaytarish ehtimoli bo‘lsa, yorliq va himoya belgisini saqlab, buyurtmaning qaytarish shartlarini o‘qish. **Format:** bosqichma-bosqich ro‘yxat.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Aksiyada olingan poyabzal mos kelmasa, keyingi qadamni shoshilmasdan tanlashga yordam beradi.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 9/10. ([agreement.dewu.com](https://agreement.dewu.com/client/view?from=5f83ff7b57c2c0780741fd42&id=127AG56CG1DDA&utm_source=openai))\n\n7. **Taobao: Kupon uchun kerakmas buyum olishga arziydimi?**\n   - **Burchak:** Kupon shartini o‘qib, faqat kerakli buyum narxini qo‘shimcha mahsulot qo‘shilgan savat bilan solishtirish. **Format:** sodda taqqoslash jadvali.\n   - **Nega hozir:** 11.11 davrida chegirma sharti ortiqcha xaridga undamasligini tekshirish foydali.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 10/10. ([consumer.ftc.gov](https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/online-shopping?utm_source=openai))\n\n8. **Tmall: Poyabzalning ustki qismi qanday materialdan?**\n   - **Burchak:** Kuzgi etik yoki kundalik poyabzal tavsifida ustki qism materialini tekshirish; yozuv noaniq bo‘lsa, sotuvchidan aniqlashtirish. **Format:** foydali maslahat va original illyustratsiya.\n   - **Nega hozir:** Kuz-qishda poyabzalni ko‘rinishiga emas, tavsifiga ham qarab tanlashga yordam beradi.\n   - **Foydalilik:** 8/10. ([scjgj.fujian.gov.cn](https://scjgj.fujian.gov.cn/zt/zl",
